=D. Image B is misleading because it shows an older cafeteria-area fountain instead of the new gym refill station.#Correct. Step 1: identify the production or publication skill in the standard. Step 2: connect the answer to the embedded journalism scenario. This answer works because it protects accuracy, uses evidence, improves clarity, follows format expectations, or supports the intended audience.
}
